===Etymology===
From {{inh|cs|sla-pro|*mysliti}}, from {{der|cs|ine-pro|*muHdʰ-}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{cs-IPA}}
* {{audio|cs|Cs-myslet.ogg|audio}}

===Verb===
{{cs-verb|a=i}}

# to [[think]] {{gloss|to reckon, to estimate}}
#: {{uxi|cs|'''Myslím''', [[že]] [[to]] [[zvládnout|zvládneš]].|I '''think''' you're going to make it.}}
# to [[think]] {{gloss|to think about}}
#: {{uxi|cs|[[muset|Musel]] [[jsem]] [[na]] [[ni]] '''myslet''' [[celý]] [[den]].|I had to '''think''' about her all day long.}}
# to [[mean]]
#: {{uxi|cs|'''Myslel''' [[jsem]] [[to]] [[metaforický|metaforicky]].|I '''meant''' it metaphorically.}}
# {{cs-reflexive|i}} to [[think]], to [[guess]], to [[suppose]]

